Jello Music Framework NOTICE
============================

Jello Music Framework
Copyright (c) 2026 Margele1337
License: MIT (see LICENSE)

This repository is the local-first framework edition of the author's Jello
Music desktop application. It contains no online music API client, no account
system, and no sidecar process. The player UI, Electron shell, playback queue,
spectrum, desktop lyrics, tray integration, and settings are the author's
original work.

