Sigma UI and branding
---------------------
The Sigma UI components, Sigma image assets, and the Jello/Sigma name and logo
are the repository owner's original work, relicensed for this repository under
MIT. They contain no third-party application code or proprietary game assets.

Local media
-----------
The application does not ship music. It indexes audio files chosen by the user
and serves them to the renderer through the `jello-local://` protocol. Audio
files, embedded artwork, and sidecar `.lrc` files remain on the user's disk and
under the user's own licenses.
